          { "t": "text", "v": " " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "pair", "ref": "v-pair" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " Anna Devis and Daniel Rueda love travelling." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "They have been to many places in Spain, " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "France", "zh": "法国" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ", " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "Italy", "zh": "意大利" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ", " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "Denmark", "zh": "丹麦" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ", and other countries. During their travel, they " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "interact with", "zh": "与……互动" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " the shapes and colours of buildings. Their " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "playful", "ref": "v-playful" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " photos will make you look twice and smile." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "They look for funny windows, colourful doors, and tall walls to make " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "creative", "ref": "v-creative" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " photos. One photo shows Daniel “climbing” the wall like Spider-Man, and another shows Anna " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "pretending", "zh": "假装" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " to “" },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "hold up", "ref": "v-hold-up" },
          { "t": "text", "v": "” the red building as if it were a red umbrella." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "The pair has a large " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "following", "zh": "追随者" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "on the internet", "ref": "v-on-the-internet" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ". People love their fun ideas. “" },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "Keep up", "ref": "v-keep-up-sth" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " the great work!” fans say. “Can I play with you?” one girl asked. “Sure!” Anna and Daniel answered happily. They love sharing their joy with the world." }
        ]
      }
